<title>JAPAN: Micronics Japan -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Micronics Japan -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.01		vs	    4.78</p>
<p> Operating	    1.30		vs	    1.03</p>
